    "flavor_text_entries": [
      {
        "flavor_text": "ひこう　そくどは　じそく２００キロ。 ドラメシヤと　いっしょに　たたかい ぶじに　しんかするまで　せわをする。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il vole à une vitesse de 200 km/h et se bat aux côtés d’un Fantyrm, dont il prend soin jusqu’à son évolution.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It’s capable of flying faster than 120 mph. It battles alongside Dreepy and dotes on them until they successfully evolve.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "飛行速度は　時速２００キロ。 ドラメシヤと　いっしょに　戦い 無事に　進化するまで　世話をする。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "せわをする　ドラメシヤを　あたまに のせていないと　おちつかないので ほかの　ポケモンを　のせようとする。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il prend soin du Fantyrm sur sa tête. Quand ce dernier n’est plus là, il panique et tente de le remplacer par un autre Pokémon.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Without a Dreepy to place on its head and care for, it gets so uneasy it’ll try to substitute any Pokémon it finds for the missing Dreepy.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "世話をする　ドラメシヤを　頭に 乗せていないと　落ち着かないので ほかの　ポケモンを　乗せようとする。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
